### 2. Specialist Engine & Baseline Ladder

#### [NEW] [cyclone_specialist.py](file:///c:/Users/adity/OneDrive/Desktop/SIH26079-RII/backend/app/builder2/cyclone_specialist.py)
- `CycloneReliabilitySpecialist`:
  - Implements the baseline ladder:
    1. Historical track difficulty / climatology baseline
    2. Ensemble track spread baseline
    3. Spread-to-track-bust logistic regression
    4. V3 + cyclone features (steering flow, shear, pressure tendency)
    5. Rapid intensification specialist (calibrated for high-shear vs low-shear transitions)
    6. Conformal track uncertainty challenger (calibrated radius at 80% and 90% coverage)
    7. Landfall timing & location displacement estimators (strictly null when offshore/no-landfall)
  - Integrates into `ReliabilityState` with hazard curves, survival curves, and recovery dynamics.
  - OOD detection and selective prediction abstention logic.

